  "schema_version": 1,
  "summary": "Who owns a path's bytes after it is installed, and what the three readings of it mean. The reconciler computes WHICH CELL a path is in, from three digests and nothing else; what the cell MEANS is stated here. A new install mode is a row in `modes`; a new kind of ownership is an entry in `stewards`. Neither is an edit to an interpreter.",
